sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Usuario
    participant F as Editor React
    participant B as FastAPI
    participant A as Motor local
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant WS as WebSocket
    U->>F: Describe refinamiento
    F->>B: POST refine + revision + client_message_id
    B->>A: Clasificar e inferir contrato tipado
    A-->>B: Patch + referencias no resueltas
    B->>DB: Mensajes + AiAction proposed
    B-->>F: Propuesta, no aplicada
    U->>F: Confirmar
    F->>B: POST action/confirm
    B->>DB: Verificar revision y transaccion atomica
    DB-->>B: Commit
    B->>WS: METHOD_SPECIFICATION_CREATED/UPDATED
    B-->>F: Accion aplicada

